      "observed_at": "2026-10-29T21:51:32.823755+00:00",
      "title": "Final R sources and ARM64/WebR artifacts verified",
      "message": "Dated checks between 20:56 and 21:51 UTC verified four R source archives, eight Windows ARM64 release/devel binaries and four WebR artifacts: Formats 0.2.13, DMD 0.2.14, IO 0.2.11 and Datasets 0.3.15. Version, R source revision and SHA-256 matched every real download. The complete DMD, IO and Datasets build runs succeeded. Existing runtime tags and registry artifacts remain unchanged; the R packaging corrections have separate source revisions. IO retains a documented R metadata NOTE about inst/LICENSE, with no ERROR or WARNING. No CRAN submission is claimed.",
