      "title": "External macOS preparation failures remain visible",
      "message": "The Formats R-oldrel macOS ARM64 job failed at 20:47 UTC during upstream runner preparation, before downloading the package source: rustup-init was absent. The earlier DAG 0.3.43 retry failed for the same external reason at 20:07 UTC. These failures are retained with their original dates; successful source and ARM64/WebR delivery does not establish universal success on every R platform.",
